Scalar newtype identity is owned by 113 runtime-core-native: Fixtures.hs,
NativeOracle.hs and RuntimeTest replace this family's scalarCastEntry helpers
and ScalarLexicalProofTest identity method. RawInt remains here for the separate
primitive arithmetic/conversion controls. This consolidation covers the shared
pre-Tidy export only; it does not qualify this family's post-Tidy paths.
Boxed polymorphic/returned-function join controls are owned by 118 source-core's
RepresentationAudit and RealCoreJoinTest. The separate join producer and its
