Shared installed fixture artifact flow (read once for later entries)
Owner: t/haskell-fixtures/InstalledCoreFixtures.hs:prepareInstalledCoreProfile.
IN: selected GHC/GHC_PKG/CABAL; built thc-fixtures and production Driver modules;
  thc.cabal/Cabal package closure; dist-newstyle/cache/plan.json; installed package
  registrations, their transitive interfaces/native libraries; target-layout.c.
