  content-keyed cache; a cold pinned provider can rebuild full boot libraries.
  Current component selection and retention cover whole dependency units, and
  the auditor decodes every supplied module. This cost is not execution-qualified.
  Acquisition is not runtime/compilation/GC
  evidence, and the arithmetic oracle does not demonstrate GC finalization.

