    OUT core-symbols library/interfaces.
  exe:thc-compact:
    IN src/cbd/tool/Main.hs; compact-core/base/aeson/bytestring.
    OUT decoder/encoder executable. CBD inspection in Python requires this tool.
  exe:thc-interface:
    IN src/compiler/interface/Main.hs; lib:thc; GHC and declared libraries.
    OUT interface extraction executable used by installed-Core acquisition.
  lib:driver:
    IN declared src/driver/THC/Driver modules; compact-core, Cabal/Cabal-syntax,
      ghc-boot and other thc.cabal libraries, unix on non-Windows.
    OUT driver library/interfaces consumed by fixture acquisition helpers.
